    "Scouting Notes": "POST DRAFT NOTES\n Transferred from Iona to Boston College for the 2025 season\n Left handed hitter with sneaky pop\n Setup and swing are Curtis Granderson esque\n Twitchy bat speed with fast hands and potential for all fields power \n Above average bat to ball skills, have improved during his college years\n Improved chase rate as well\n Swing does leave some room to attack the top of the strike zone with fastballs\n Punishes pitches down in the zone and shows above average raw power against them\n Generally good feel for the barrel\n Above average runner, though the speed plays better on the bases than in the field currently\n Potential for speed to impact defense \n Profiles better in left field presently, but the speed could play in center if he improves reads and reactions\n Arm is likely to play better in left than right as well\n Very intrigued by the bat. Hopefully he can improve enough to handle CF defensively",
